 "title": "Menominee County | Departments » Treasurer",
 "text": "Menominee County | Departments » Treasurer\n|\n|\n|\n|\nIMPORTANT NOTICE REGARDING PROPERTY TAX PAYMENTS BY MAIL: A MESSAGE REGARDING USPS POSTMARKS\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nGovernment\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoards & Committees\nEmployment\nForms & Documents\nMunicipalities\nServices\nDepartments\n9-1-1 (Central Dispatch)\nAdministration\nBuilding Codes\nClerk\nCounty Board of Commissioners\nCounty Fair\nCourts\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nLand Information Services (GIS)\nMenominee County Library\nMenominee Regional Airport\nParks & Recreation\nProsecuting Attorney\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nCommunity\nArea Information\nCUPPAD\nM & M Regional Guide\nMenominee Conservation District\nMenominee County 4-H\nMichigan Department of Health & Human Services\nMichigan State University - Extension\nNorthpointe Behavioral Health\nPublic Health - Delta & Menominee Counties\nUPCAP - Upper Peninsula Commission for Area Progress\nMore\nCalendar\nContact Us\nEmail Alerts\nFAQ\nLinks\nNews\nStaff Directory\n-->\nTREASURER |\n|\n• General Information |\n|\n- |\n|\nStaff |\n|\n- |\n|\nAddress Change Request |\n|\n- |\n|\nDog License |\n|\n- |\n|\nFreedom of Information Act |\n|\n- |\n|\nPlat Book |\n|\n- |\n|\nProperty Tax & Home Heating Credits |\n|\n- |\n|\nContact Us |\n|\n• Delinquent Property Tax Information |\n|\n• Auction of Tax Foreclosed Properties |\n|\n• Michigan Unclaimed Property/Estates |\n|\n-->\n- Select Section --> TREASURER General Information Staff Address Change Request Dog License Freedom of Information Act Plat Book Property Tax & Home Heating Credits Contact Us Delinquent Property Tax Information Auction of Tax Foreclosed Properties Michigan Unclaimed Property/Estates DEPARTMENTS HOME\nTreasurer\nThe Office of the County Treasurer was established by the Michigan Constitution. The County Treasurer is authorized by the Michigan Constitution and Statutes to serve as the County's Investment Officer and Banker. Under State law, the County Treasurer's primary duties are as the custodian of all County funds, and as the collector of delinquent real property taxes.\nBy Statute, the County Treasurer is a member of the Plat Board, the Election Commission, and may also serve on other boards or commissions.\nThe Office of County Treasurer fulfills many other responsibilities, such as:\n• Accounting of all revenue and investments\n• Foreclosing Governmental Unit for property tax foreclosures\n• Administrative agent for the Delinquent Tax Revolving Fund\n• Sale of dog licenses\n• Tax clearance of deeds and other documents pertaining to tax histories\nContact: |\nBarbara Parrett - Menominee County Treasurer\nPhone: 906-863-5548\nClick here to email |\nMailing Address: |\n839 10th Avenue\nMenominee MI 49858\nMap |\nHours: |\nMonday - Friday\n8:00am - 4:30pm |\nCopyright © 2026 Menominee County\nGovernment - Menominee Michigan\nMenominee County Courthouse\n839 10th Avenue\nMenominee, MI 49858\n(906) 863-7779\nLegal Notice\nPrivacy Notice\nAcceptable Use Policy\nLinking Policy\nDesigned & Powered By:",
